OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled overnight with light winds and
OL,7,Flengthy clear spells. Becoming cold
OL,8,Fagain, with a frost developing across
OL,9,Fmany inland areas by morning. Turning
OL,10,Fbreezy for the Outer Hebrides.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAnother cold start with an
OL,13,Finland frost. Largely sunny through
OL,14,Fthe day, but more cloud developing
OL,15,Facross the Western Isles where it will
OL,16,Falso be quite windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
