OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fmainly dry and sunny, but south
OL,7,Fturning cloudy later. Turning
OL,8,Funsettled on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,9,Fwith cloud and rain at times.
